   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">19 High Road &middot; Motherwell</p>\n          <h1 id=\"hero-title\">A Victorian house, <em>between Glasgow and Edinburgh</em></h1>\n          <p class=\"lede\">Eighteen en-suite bedrooms, a locally renowned restaurant and a function suite for up to 120 guests, all inside the sandstone villa on Motherwell&rsquo;s High Road that was once called Motherwell House.</p>\n          <div class=\"btn-row\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"book.html\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4\"/><path d=\"M8 2v4\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18\"/></svg>Check availability</a>\n            <a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"rooms.html\">Explore our rooms</a>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"hero__facts\">\n            <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M4 11h16\"/><path d=\"M12 3v8\"/><path d=\"m8 19-2 3\"/><path d=\"m18 22-2-3\"/><path d=\"M8 15h0\"/><path d=\"M16 15h0\"/></svg>5 minutes&rsquo; walk to Motherwell station</li>\n            <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 17h6\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"/></svg>Free on-site parking</li>\n            <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 13a10 10 0 0 1 14 0\"/><path d=\"M8.5 16.5a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"/><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0\"/><path d=\"M12 20h.01\"/></svg>Free WiFi</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero__media\">\n          <div class=\"hero__frame\">\n            <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/exterior-700.webp 700w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/exterior-700.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/exterior-700.jpg 700w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"700\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Bentley Hotel: a sandstone Victorian villa with a tall square tower, stepped gables and bay windows, with the glass conservatory to the left\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"hero__badge\">\n            <strong>1874</strong>\n            <span>The year Motherwell House was built</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
