  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"welcome-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"split split--wide-text\">\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Welcome to Bentley Hotel</p>\n            <h2 id=\"welcome-title\">A touch of comfort after a long day</h2>\n            <p class=\"lede\">Bentley Hotel sits in a historic building once known as Motherwell House. It was built in 1874 and has been home to many of Motherwell&rsquo;s founding families.</p>\n            <p>The story handed down with the house is that it was built for Colonel Black of the Cameronians. Its sandstone exterior has kept its Victorian character, and inside, alongside the bedrooms, you&rsquo;ll find our restaurant, a conservatory and a bar.</p>\n            <p>We&rsquo;re on High Road, inside Motherwell&rsquo;s Hamilton Road Conservation Area, next door to the North Lanarkshire Heritage Centre and a short walk from Motherwell station. That makes us an easy base for work, a match at Fir Park, a family occasion, or a few days exploring Glasgow, Edinburgh and the Clyde Valley.</p>\n            <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"history.html\">Read the story of the house <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <div class=\"stats\">\n              <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat__value\">18</span><span class=\"stat__label\">En-suite bedrooms</span></div>\n              <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat__value\">120</span><span class=\"stat__label\">Guests in our function suite</span></div>\n              <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat__value\">5 min</span><span class=\"stat__label\">Walk to the station</span></div>\n              <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"stat__value\">Free</span><span class=\"stat__label\">On-site parking</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"rooms-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro center\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Stay with us</p>\n          <h2 id=\"rooms-title\">Comfortable rooms, each with its own bathroom</h2>\n          <p>Every room has an en-suite bathroom, a TV, tea and coffee making facilities and free WiFi. Choose a single, twin, double or family room.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid--4\">\n          <a class=\"card card--link reveal\" href=\"rooms.html#single\">\n            <div class=\"card__media\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-single-1-lg.webp 1138w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, (min-width: 560px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-single-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-single-1-lg.jpg 1138w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, (min-width: 560px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"card__body\">\n              <p class=\"card__meta\">Sleeps 1</p>\n              <h3>Single Room</h3>\n              <p>A practical room for solo travellers and business trips.</p>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"card card--link reveal\" href=\"rooms.html#twin\">\n            <div class=\"card__media\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-twin-2-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, (min-width: 560px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-twin-2-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, (min-width: 560px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"card__body\">\n              <p class=\"card__meta\">Sleeps 2</p>\n              <h3>Twin Room</h3>\n              <p>Two single beds. Ideal for friends, colleagues or wedding guests.</p>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"card card--link reveal\" href=\"rooms.html#double\">\n            <div class=\"card__media\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-double-1-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, (min-width: 560px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-double-1-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, (min-width: 560px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"515\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"card__body\">\n              <p class=\"card__meta\">Sleeps 2</p>\n              <h3>Double Room</h3>\n              <p>A double bed for couples; some rooms have a bay window.</p>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"card card--link reveal\" href=\"rooms.html#family\">\n            <div class=\"card__media\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-family-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-family-1-lg.webp 1334w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, (min-width: 560px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-family-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-family-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-family-1-lg.jpg 1334w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 25vw, (min-width: 560px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"card__body\">\n              <p class=\"card__meta\">Sleeps up to 3</p>\n              <h3>Family Room</h3>\n              <p>A double and a single bed for families travelling together.</p>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"btn-row center\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn--dark\" href=\"rooms.html\">View all rooms</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn--outline\" href=\"book.html\">Book direct</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"dining-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"split split--reverse\">\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <dl class=\"info-list\">\n              <div><dt>Breakfast</dt><dd>Full Scottish, cooked to order</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Restaurant</dt><dd>Scottish and British cooking, for guests and visitors</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Conservatory</dt><dd>Bright, relaxed dining beside the restaurant</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Bar</dt><dd>A drink before dinner or at the end of the day</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Bookings</dt><dd><a href=\"tel:+441698265588\">01698 265588</a></dd></div>\n            </dl>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Restaurant &amp; Bar</p>\n            <h2 id=\"dining-title\">Scottish cooking, with a conservatory to linger in</h2>\n            <p>Our comfortable and spacious restaurant opens onto a purpose-built conservatory, where you can relax and enjoy your meal. Breakfast is cooked to order each morning.</p>\n            <p>The restaurant is also the place for family meals and celebrations, and there&rsquo;s a bar for a drink at the end of the day. Please call to check opening times and book a table.</p>\n            <div class=\"btn-row\">\n              <a class=\"btn btn--dark\" href=\"dining.html\">Restaurant &amp; bar</a>\n              <a class=\"btn btn--outline\" href=\"tel:+441698265588\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.12 4.18 2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/></svg>Call to book a table</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--green\" aria-labelledby=\"events-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro center\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Celebrate &amp; meet</p>\n          <h2 id=\"events-title\">Weddings, functions and meetings for up to 120</h2>\n          <p class=\"lede\">Our air-conditioned function suite and conservatory host everything from intimate weddings to conferences, birthdays and family gatherings.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid--3\">\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Weddings</h3>\n            <p>Ceremony and reception under one roof, for 4 to 100 guests, with evening receptions for up to 120.</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-2\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"weddings.html\">Weddings at Bentley Hotel <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Meetings &amp; conferences</h3>\n            <p>Our function suite, the Back o&rsquo; Barns room, takes up to 120 delegates, depending on layout, with free parking and the station nearby.</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-2\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"functions.html\">Functions &amp; meetings <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 22h8\"/><path d=\"M12 11v11\"/><path d=\"m19 3-7 8-7-8Z\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Celebrations</h3>\n            <p>Birthdays, anniversaries, christenings and funeral receptions, catered by our own kitchen.</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-2\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"contact.html?enquiry=Function\">Plan your occasion <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--sand quote-band\" aria-label=\"The story of the house\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <svg class=\"ornament\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 8h46M74 8h46\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M60 1l7 7-7 7-7-7z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <div class=\"quote-band__text\">\n          <p>When the house was built in 1874, Motherwell was growing from a weaving village into the iron and steel town later nicknamed &ldquo;Steelopolis&rdquo;.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"btn-row center\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn--outline\" href=\"history.html\">Our history</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"location-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Getting here</p>\n          <h2 id=\"location-title\">Easy to reach by rail and road</h2>\n          <p>Glasgow is about 12 miles away and Edinburgh about 30, with the M74 and M8 motorways close by.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid--4\">\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M4 11h16\"/><path d=\"M12 3v8\"/><path d=\"m8 19-2 3\"/><path d=\"m18 22-2-3\"/><path d=\"M8 15h0\"/><path d=\"M16 15h0\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>By train</h3>\n            <p>Motherwell station is about a 5-minute walk away, with direct trains to Glasgow, Edinburgh and London.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 22 8 2\"/><path d=\"m20 22-4-20\"/><path d=\"M12 6v2\"/><path d=\"M12 12v2\"/><path d=\"M12 18v2\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>By car</h3>\n            <p>Close to junction 6 of the M74, with the M8 a few miles north. Free parking on site.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.2c.4-.3.6-.7.5-1.2z\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>By air</h3>\n            <p>Glasgow Airport is roughly 30 minutes by car and Edinburgh Airport about 45, traffic permitting.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M17 14h.01\"/><path d=\"M12 22v-7\"/><path d=\"M9 15h6\"/><path d=\"M12 2 5 12h4l-2 3h10l-2-3h4Z\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>On the doorstep</h3>\n            <p>The Heritage Centre is next door. Strathclyde Country Park, M&amp;D&rsquo;s and Fir Park are all about 2 miles.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"mt-2\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"location.html\">Directions &amp; things to do nearby <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
