   "html": "<section class=\"section section--sand\" aria-labelledby=\"gallery-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro center\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Gallery</p>\n          <h2 id=\"gallery-title\">A look around the house</h2>\n          <p>A few of our rooms, and the house itself. There are more photographs in the gallery.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid--3\">\n          <a class=\"card card--link reveal\" href=\"gallery.html\">\n            <div class=\"card__media\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-double-1-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-double-1-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"515\" alt=\"Double room with a large bay window, a blue throw on the bed, a grey armchair and the en-suite door open\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"card__body\">\n              <p class=\"card__meta\">Rooms</p>\n              <h3>A double with a bay window</h3>\n              <p>Some of our double rooms have the bay windows that give the house its character.</p>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"card card--link reveal\" href=\"gallery.html\">\n            <div class=\"card__media\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-twin-2-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-twin-2-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Twin room with two single beds in teal throws and cushions, dark curtains and a colourful canvas on a teal wall\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"card__body\">\n              <p class=\"card__meta\">Rooms</p>\n              <h3>A twin room</h3>\n              <p>Two single beds, each with its own throw and cushions, for friends or colleagues sharing.</p>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"card card--link reveal\" href=\"gallery.html\">\n            <div class=\"card__media\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/exterior-700.webp 700w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/exterior-700.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/exterior-700.jpg 700w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"700\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Bentley Hotel from the street: a sandstone Victorian villa with a tall square tower, stepped gables and bay windows, the glass conservatory to the left and hedges in front\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"card__body\">\n              <p class=\"card__meta\">The house</p>\n              <h3>Motherwell House, 1874</h3>\n              <p>The sandstone villa on High Road, with its tower, stepped gables and the conservatory where we serve meals.</p>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"btn-row center\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn--dark\" href=\"gallery.html\">View the gallery</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
